{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "設位本方而日圓者，取周帀回旋之義也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "表南無阿彌陀佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若佛聲太急，即于此時改魚緩念。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "封面寫念佛七期回向發願疏，秉教修淨主七沙門某甲具緘。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附錄"}
